{"story_id":65270,"updated_at":"2026-11-06T19:00:25","headline_en":"Bigg Boss 20 hits 1 billion watch hours in under 60 days","headline_hi":"बिग बॉस 20 ने 60 दिन से कम समय में 1 अरब वॉच ऑवर्स पूरे किए","payload_en":{"story_id":65270,"headline":"Bigg Boss 20 hits 1 billion watch hours in under 60 days","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Aaj Tak","Hindustan Times"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":65270,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-06T19:00:25","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["Big Boss","JioHotstar","Bigg Boss Hindi Season","Colors","Salman Khan","Starzplay"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"On 6 November, Big Boss 20 surpassed 1 billion watch-time hours on JioHotstar in less than 60 days.","ids":[105677],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"On Monday, Bigg Boss Hindi Season 20 crossed 100 crore watch-time hours on JioHotstar in under 60 days.","ids":[105684],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"It premiered on 6 September on JioHotstar and Colors TV, and it is the fastest season to achieve 100 crore watch-time hours.","ids":[105692,105690],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"The show is the number 1 title on Starzplay in the UAE.","ids":[105683],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Host Salman Khan commented on the milestone.","ids":[105685],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"\"Big Boss 20 received more than 3.5 billion votes,\" JioStar said.","ids":[105679],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"The number of fans voting for the show increased by 48%, and it has gone up by 48%.","ids":[105681,105689],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"A reality show franchise ran for 20 years in India.","ids":[105696],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Big Boss 20 is part of a reality show franchise.","ids":[105695],"class":"single","sources":[1]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","say","numbers","background"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.aajtak.in/entertainment/television/story/salman-khan-bigg-boss-20-crosses-100-crore-watch-time-hours-in-just-60-days-tmovg-dskc-2690138-2026-11-06","outlet":"Aaj Tak","title":"सलमान खान के शर्ट उतारने का कमाल, 'बिग बॉस 20' ने रचा इतिहास","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/tv/bigg-boss-20-crosses-100-crore-watch-time-hours-in-under-60-days-becomes-fastest-season-to-achieve-milestone-salman-khan-101793964771041.html","outlet":"Hindustan Times","title":"Bigg Boss 20 crosses 100 crore watch-time hours in under 60 days, becomes fastest season to achieve milestone","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true}],"other_coverage":[{"text":"The show is among the top 5 titles on JioHotstar in the UK, Canada, and Singapore.","ids":[105682],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Salman Khan stated that the audience stays connected to every moment of the show outside the house.","ids":[105693],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Reaching 100 crore watch-time hours on JioHotstar is a testament to the incredible love and connection our viewers share with the show.","ids":[105694],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],"who":[null,null,"JioStar",null,null]},"timeline":[],"undated":[],"established":[],"contested":[{"text":"The number of votes for Big Boss 20 increased by 71% compared to the previous season.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":2,"sources":[{"outlet":"Aaj Tak","url":"https://www.aajtak.in/entertainment/television/story/salman-khan-bigg-boss-20-crosses-100-crore-watch-time-hours-in-just-60-days-tmovg-dskc-2690138-2026-11-06","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/tv/bigg-boss-20-crosses-100-crore-watch-time-hours-in-under-60-days-becomes-fastest-season-to-achieve-milestone-salman-khan-101793